eventfd with nothing, and with too much => ("TypeError: eventfd() missing required argument 'initval' (pos 1)", 'TypeError: eventfd() takes at most 2 arguments (9 given)', "TypeError: eventfd() missing required argument 'initval' (pos 1)")
